$multi_text
 XSTR("At 1415 hours, the Shivan corvette $h Abraxis and a wing of $h Manticore fighters attacked the convoy. The $f Nebtuu called for assistance, so you're going in. Theta wing will stand by to reinforce your position. Call them in at your discretion. Good luck, pilots. The people of Capella are counting on you.", 1758)
$end_multi_text
